## Remove a glob pattern from a settings list

1. In the list hover the mouse over the **glob pattern** to be removed. *- red rectangle

2. Two icon buttons appear at the end of the item line. Click the `X` button. *- yellow rectangle

{{::il.Vscode_Settings_User_ExcludeGitIgnore_img}}

3. The row is removed from the list.

